4928185540a0447ed8e9957ca324eb0c980d30dd0213a5779736d5a1","rendered_turn_sha256":"c64eca02e9e28ead9c8b5c0917cc3478628999dbfc7d498f30433797d2c44057","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"cf471c47b1654bbb9f528003473a46f74d24cccd7175316d05f15107ccbb1cdd","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":15},{"dia_id":"D28:16","global_turn_index":499,"locator":"[S28T16]","raw_turn_sha256":"c6564e0e7f0f125dda5cffc7b3f3a43695f545b8ab50186c15d1f82e4e6c9920","rendered_turn_sha256":"3a2b2be3be4399f0a4b922df5a9eb2e3757d6a3b4262a884f144a2d9ffe78a9f","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"eaf9b6c5338dd2366c699aedfebace113a6c078435496e7065e494378561b368","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":16},{"dia_id":"D28:17","global_turn_index":500,"locator":"[S28T17]","raw_turn_sha256":"52901351e144483c8c83539892a6ccac05e3f37faaabb304d8127249cc38d4a3","rendered_turn_sha256":"2af69a86deef0593e9a4a51ed122dbdc35209f05462c5efa371d19f6b34a232a","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"07a252e246b04680d04b846437b2213598d7d16f025541e0f683ec73008f0c07","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":17},{"dia_id":"D28:18","global_turn_index":501,"locator":"[S28T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"9cc7888912695124f2bff3010d219fc3b28e5ef676d770fcd6808305f1ddd065","rendered_turn_sha256":"bf409a5cdc2f3fe989c2078e0a011ada29f2cffb1076b626c1d15eb3442f18e5","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"8c6afb1446b143d00ea01663af38099274231cf662b100924588827eec8e1267","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Thanks, Dave! It was an awesome feeling seeing everyone come together to celebrate - super rewarding! Look at this photo showcasing how wonderfully we spent our time!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people dancing at a party]\n[S28T3] (dia_id: D28:3)\n\nDave: Wow, great job, Calvin! Congrats! What was it like when everyone was cheering you on?\n[S28T4] (dia_id: D28:4)\n\nCalvin: It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\n[Image caption: a photo of a group of people standing on top of a stage]\n[S28T5] (dia_id: D28:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\n[S28T6] (dia_id: D28:6)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It's an awesome feeling. Creating something that people connect with and brings joy is what I'm all about. Moments like this really motivate me to keep growing!\n[S28T7] (dia_id: D28:7)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, imagining how your music affects others must be incredible! Keep up the great work! By the way, I recently started a blog on car mods. It's my way to share my passion with others. Do you have any tips on blogging for me? Just take a look at this beautiful car!\n\n\n[Image caption: a photography of a car website design]\n[S28T8] (dia_id: D28:8)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! It's really fun to share your passion through blogging. Have you had any success stories yet with inspiring others?\n[S28T9] (dia_id: D28:9)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It's awesome people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice. I recently posted about how I made this car look like a beast, and it was great to hear it inspired others to start their own DIY projects.\n[Image caption: a photography of a blue subarunt parked in a parking lot]\n[S28T10] (dia_id: D28:10)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! Your blog is awesome. Helping others get creative is awesome. Keep up the great work!\n[S28T11] (dia_id: D28:11)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I appreciate the support. It's fulfilling to share my knowledge and help others unleash their creativity.\n[S28T12] (dia_id: D28:12)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, keep doing what you do! Your blog and car mods are inspiring and a great way to help people find their creativity.\n[S28T13] (dia_id: D28:13)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It means a lot that you enjoy my blog. This car mod was a lot of work, but I think it was worth it in the end.\n[Image caption: a photography of a blue subarunt parked in a parking lot]\n[S28T14] (dia_id: D28:14)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, those headlights look great! What did you do to get them looking so good?\n[S28T15] (dia_id: D28:15)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I spent a lot of time cleaning, polishing, and protecting them - they look great! Just take a look at this photo – these headlights are enchanting!\n\n\n[Image caption: a photography of a blue car parked on a road at night]\n[S28T16] (dia_id: D28:16)\n\nCalvin: Wow, they look great! You really put in a lot of effort. Well done!\n[S28T17] (dia_id: D28:17)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Really appreciate you noticing the effort I put into this.\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car with a black engine and a red hood]\n[S28T18] (dia_id: D28:18)","text_sha256":"193ba350886a7cf17b37d454543d5f71b32bd79b429b1f89dfe22f2414bb1720","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D25:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":43,"line_start":42,"source_locators":["[S25T11]"],"text_sha256":"6d9ad59cab36f1cfb104447f015ca7eb5c6788ffa1680d08dcf91538b7c8b962"},{"dia_ids":["D25:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":46,"line_start":45,"source_locators":["[S25T12]"],"text_sha256":"9d4f596a3aa0c3596789761d12a3ab486e26be826f964625b1305948bfa965b5"},{"dia_ids":["D25:13"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":50,"line_start":48,"source_locators":["[S25T13]"],"text_sha256":"51aec8cb4ebf6b2cd584c105b4d951cc486e44d9359d961f0304f3ced8d39fb5"},{"dia_ids":["D25:14"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":53,"line_start":52,"s